# Host-only model/node installers ship in Git, not in the CPU application image.
# Their source, manifests, CUDA environment and model weights stay on the user
# controlled inference host. The application needs only workflows/ and its HTTP
# adapters; do not broaden !scripts/** to include private acceptance tools.
scripts/local_inference/**
runtime-manifests/**
!docker/
!docker/**
